===Etymology===
{{suffix|quantize|ation}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|kwântĭzāshôn}}
* {{hyphenation|quan|ti|za|tion}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{context|uncountable|signal processing|lang=en}} The [[process]] of [[approximating]] a [[continuous]] [[signal]] by a [[set]] of [[discrete]] [[symbol]]s or [[integer]] [[value]]s.
# {{context|countable|physics|lang=en}} A [[procedure]] for [[constructing]] a [[quantum field theory]] starting from a [[classical field theory]].

